              "note": null,
              "raw": "lo=k-dŭyašno raġli b-i=squftayḏe ʻich setze den Fuss nicht mehr über seine Schwelleʼ; 520; 1/67;"
            },
            {
              "id": "dyš.I.t.infectum.3",
              "sense": null,
              "turoyo": "ḥzay áydarbo g-dašno ʕal qḏolə-d-u=šulṭono-ste!",
              "translation": "Schau, wie ich sogar auf den Nacken des Sultans trete!",
              "refs": [
                {
                  "raw": "27/68",
                  "kind": "text",
                  "textId": "R027",
                  "verse": 68
                }
              ],
              "note": null,
              "raw": "ḥzay áydarbo g-dašno ʕal qḏolə-d-u=šulṭono-ste! ‘Schau, wie ich sogar auf den Nacken des Sultans trete!’; 27/68;"
            },
            {
              "id": "dyš.I.t.infectum.4",
              "sense": null,
              "turoyo": "ono qoláʕ-way-no u=dōlmiš. (…). kačke d-aṭ=ṭaye, ʕəmra tašʕo=əšne, hăma ḥəḷḷi mḥalaqla ruḥa l-i=qamayt-ayḏi. ono-ze mayeli u=dōlmiš m-aʕla d-lo=doyašno aʕla",
              "translation": "I was driving a minibus. (…). A Muslim girl, nine years old… and I saw: she threw herself in front of me. I turned the minibus away from her in order not to run her over",
              "refs": [
                {
                  "raw": "JL 14.8.3",
                  "kind": "jl",
                  "textId": null,
                  "verse": null
                }
              ],
              "note": null,
              "raw": "ono qoláʕ-way-no u=dōlmiš. (…). kačke d-aṭ=ṭaye, ʕəmra tašʕo=əšne, hăma ḥəḷḷi mḥalaqla ruḥa l-i=qamayt-ayḏi. ono-ze mayeli u=dōlmiš m-aʕla d-lo=doyašno aʕla ‘I was driving a minibus. (…). A Muslim girl, nine years old… and I saw: she threw herself in front of me. I turned the minibus away from her in order not to run her over’ JL 14.8.3;"
            }
